@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Feature 003 - Owner Export, Limits and Failure Paths
actor Teacher
participant "ExportResultsButton\nBinary helper" as UI
participant "Teacher export route" as Route
participant "Session / CSRF / Owner" as Auth
participant "Resource gate" as Gate
participant "Result reader" as Reader
database SQLite
participant "Pure order + CSV codec" as Codec
Teacher -> UI : Click single activity export
UI -> Route : GET /api/activities/:id/export.csv + CSRF
Route -> Auth : validate session, origin, inputs, generation
Auth -> SQLite : owner-filtered metadata / ended
alt invalid identity, non-owner, phase or input
  Auth --> Route : safe error
  Route --> UI : JSON, no attachment
else authorized ended activity
  Route -> Gate : per-session rate + one generation slot
  alt rate limited or busy
    Gate --> Route : 429 RATE_LIMITED / 503 EXPORT_BUSY
    Route --> UI : JSON + Retry-After
  else admitted
    Route -> Reader : bounded synchronous snapshot
    Reader -> SQLite : BEGIN DEFERRED / preflight SELECT
    Reader -> SQLite : source + questions + groups + submissions\nanswers + frozen results + next_sequence; verify; COMMIT
    alt storage, consistency or size failure
      Reader --> Route : safe error, rollback if needed
      Route --> UI : JSON, no CSV bytes
    else complete immutable input
      Reader --> Route : ExportSnapshot
      Route -> Codec : derive ranks, layout, safe text, BOM
      loop bounded chunks, yield / deadline / cancellation
        Codec -> Auth : ensure original generation and owner
      end
      alt revoked, canceled, deadline or any limit
        Codec --> Route : safe failure
        Route --> UI : JSON if connected, no attachment
      else complete bounded bytes
        Codec --> Route : Buffer + Taipei filename
        Route -> Auth : final authorization check
        Route --> UI : 200 CSV attachment, complete body
        UI -> UI : check scope after blob; validate MIME / filename
        alt same activity / boot / session / auth generation
          UI -> UI : objectURL + anchor download, then revoke
          UI --> Teacher : Download started (not disk-save proof)
        else old context
          UI -> UI : discard, no new download or stale feedback
        end
      end
    end
    Route -> Gate : finally release slot / buffers
  end
end
note over Route,SQLite
No mutation, receipt, job wake, Google read or write.
HEAD explicitly returns 405 without invoking generator.
Headers are not sent until complete validation succeeds.
end note
@enduml
